# A two-variable fragment of the ID2 gene-regulatory MLN from:
#
#   Brouard et al., "Learning a Markov Logic network for
#   supervised gene regulatory network inference", BMC Bioinformatics 2013.
#
# The two relational formulas below are displayed among the paper's learned
# high-weight rules.  Attribute values that do not occur in the fragment are
# collapsed into SiID2Other.  The paper does not publish numerical weights for
# these individual rules in its main text, so both displayed rules are
# normalized to unit weight.  No additional unary or relation priors are used.

SiID2Level3(X) | SiID2Other(X).
~SiID2Level3(X) | ~SiID2Other(X).

1.00 PlasmaMembrane(Y) & SiID2Level3(Y) & SiID2Level3(X) -> Regulates(X,Y)
1.00 CellProliferation(Y) & NegativeRegulationCellProliferation(X) -> Regulates(X,Y)

gene = 4
